Notes: this module has no blocks, so there are no blockstates, block models or loot tables. Item textures are expected at `diaithirfilters:item/filter` and `diaithirfilters:item/filter_card` (factorio-style industrial look, supplied later). The menu screen is client-side and registered through the menu type; ghost slots are server-authoritative. Other modules take a card with `Filters.isCard(stack)` and `Filters.matches(stack, candidate)`.
